WEBVTT

00:07.007 --> 00:11.511
BEAUTIFUL PROGRAM
THE MAGIC OF HACKING

00:22.480 --> 00:25.066
MISSION COMPLETE!

00:25.150 --> 00:28.278
I'm done.

00:30.113 --> 00:33.199
I can sleep
for the first time in 80 hours.

00:47.464 --> 00:50.091
EMERGENCY QUEST
EVENT

00:50.175 --> 00:51.176
Huh?

00:51.259 --> 00:53.094
Damn it!

00:53.178 --> 00:56.014
Just when I thought I was
finally going to get some sleep...

00:56.431 --> 00:58.224
Who the hell are you?

01:06.191 --> 01:07.192
Oh, crap!

01:09.402 --> 01:11.821
Don't think you're not gonna pay for this.

01:15.283 --> 01:16.326
Ugh.

01:25.543 --> 01:26.544
Huh?

01:29.297 --> 01:30.507
Hey!

01:33.093 --> 01:35.261
Damn, it got away.

01:58.827 --> 02:05.458
YOZAKURA FAMILY

03:29.417 --> 03:35.340
PLAN 6
BUG

03:35.423 --> 03:37.759
Oh, Big Sis Shion. Good morn--

03:38.259 --> 03:39.552
Wait, are you all right?

03:40.011 --> 03:43.139
Good... Good morning.

03:43.223 --> 03:45.850
Big Sis Shion,
you pulled another all-nighter?

03:45.934 --> 03:49.938
Yeah. Some weirdo
hacked into the database yesterday.

03:50.396 --> 03:53.775
They seemed to be going through
only Taiyo's personal data.

03:53.858 --> 03:54.859
Huh?

03:54.943 --> 03:57.111
Well, not like they got
anything important.

03:57.195 --> 03:59.989
And I updated the security,
so no worries.

04:01.783 --> 04:04.244
Still, I wonder how they snuck in

04:04.327 --> 04:07.247
when nobody knows that access code
except for us siblings?

04:08.539 --> 04:11.751
I've got a really bad feeling about this.

04:16.839 --> 04:21.302
But why would they try
to steal your data and nothing else?

04:21.386 --> 04:24.681
Who knows? Whatever the reason,
it's creepy, don't you think?

04:25.223 --> 04:26.349
Hmm?

04:38.027 --> 04:39.028
This way!

04:57.547 --> 04:58.589
<i>Can't shake her!</i>

05:17.150 --> 05:21.487
Oh, how powerful!

05:21.571 --> 05:22.947
Who are you?

05:23.031 --> 05:25.700
Nice to meet you,
Master Taiyo.

05:26.534 --> 05:27.577
I love you.

05:28.077 --> 05:29.412
Now please die!

05:29.495 --> 05:30.496
Huh?

05:31.205 --> 05:32.206
Oh!

05:32.290 --> 05:33.374
What is it, Mutsumi?

05:33.458 --> 05:35.835
Those assassination needles
and that line!

05:35.918 --> 05:39.672
Are you, by any chance, Ayaka Kirisaki,
the Manhunter Spy?

05:40.757 --> 05:44.218
The next time you call me
that vulgar name "Manhunter"...

05:44.302 --> 05:46.095
I'll stick a thousand needles in your eye!

05:46.429 --> 05:47.430
A spy?

05:47.513 --> 05:50.558
Well, yes. She's famous in a bad way.

05:50.641 --> 05:53.519
<i>She uses her spy techniques
to shadow the men she's infatuated with,</i>

05:53.644 --> 05:56.064
<i>then stabs them to death with needles.</i>

05:56.147 --> 05:58.024
<i>She's a pro at tracking and assassination.</i>

05:58.107 --> 06:00.902
<i>So she's a crazy, evil stalker...</i>

06:00.985 --> 06:03.029
Wait, does that mean...

06:03.571 --> 06:05.782
Yes! I fell in love with you
at first sight!

06:05.865 --> 06:08.368
It all started with a video
on the Dark Web!

06:08.451 --> 06:11.079
By now, the whole underworld
has their eyes on you,

06:11.162 --> 06:12.955
rookie of the Yozakura family,
Master Taiyo!

06:13.039 --> 06:15.208
And just the other day,
a certain underworld company

06:15.291 --> 06:18.252
put a $100,000 bounty on your head!

06:18.336 --> 06:19.337
Huh?

06:19.420 --> 06:22.590
Now that my beloved Master
Taiyo's achievements have been recognized,

06:22.673 --> 06:24.467
I can't stop my joyous tears from flowing!

06:24.550 --> 06:26.260
It's not joyous for me at all!

06:26.344 --> 06:28.805
And why use a photo
where I look like I'm about to sneeze?

06:28.888 --> 06:31.099
But it worries me.

06:36.604 --> 06:39.565
The bounty is causing
more and more people

06:39.649 --> 06:42.026
to want to kill you for impure reasons.

06:42.110 --> 06:43.236
What?

06:43.319 --> 06:47.198
I've got to
make you mine forever

06:47.281 --> 06:50.493
before anyone can steal
even a single hair off your head!

06:50.576 --> 06:52.787
What are you talking about?
You're terrifying!

06:52.870 --> 06:56.541
I know all about
your hidden charms as well!

06:56.624 --> 06:59.419
<i>That you try not to step on the plants
when you're infiltrating,</i>

06:59.502 --> 07:02.130
<i>that you repair the buildings
damaged in your missions,</i>

07:02.213 --> 07:05.591
<i>and that when you need to take
a free train ride, you buy a ticket later.</i>

07:05.675 --> 07:07.677
Oh, you're too wonderful!

07:07.760 --> 07:09.303
How do you know all that?

07:09.387 --> 07:10.388
I totally get it.

07:10.471 --> 07:11.848
You're agreeing with her?

07:11.931 --> 07:15.810
Now, then, Master Taiyo!
Come to me now!

07:17.437 --> 07:21.149
I understand where you're coming from,
but I'm married to Mutsumi.

07:21.232 --> 07:22.942
I can't allow myself to be killed.

07:23.025 --> 07:24.110
Uh?

07:27.655 --> 07:31.033
You would pick
that ugly, wanton woman over me?

07:31.117 --> 07:34.662
She must have brainwashed you.
You poor thing!

07:34.745 --> 07:37.665
Much as I'd like to dispatch her
right this minute,

07:37.748 --> 07:40.626
I can't, because I promised Kyoichiro.

07:40.710 --> 07:41.711
Big Bro?

07:41.794 --> 07:47.091
Yes. There's no way
to target any Yozakura behind his back,

07:47.175 --> 07:50.845
so I went to him on the off chance
that I could negotiate a pass.

07:50.928 --> 07:51.929
<i>And then...</i>

07:52.013 --> 07:54.891
Taiyo? Do whatever you want to him.

07:54.974 --> 07:58.144
<i>As long as I didn't put the
third-born daughter, Mutsumi, in danger,</i>

07:58.227 --> 08:00.813
he agreed to look the other way.

08:00.897 --> 08:02.273
<i>That bastard.</i>

08:02.356 --> 08:08.154
<i>While I was at it, I asked him
if I could peruse Master Taiyo's data...</i>

08:08.237 --> 08:10.740
Oh, sure, go ahead and look!

08:10.823 --> 08:13.034
<i>...and he gave me the access code!</i>

08:13.117 --> 08:15.745
<i>That scumbag!</i>

08:25.880 --> 08:27.840
All right, I'll be back later.

08:28.508 --> 08:30.676
Until we meet again, Master Taiyo!

08:46.150 --> 08:47.652
Uh, I know this is sudden,

08:47.735 --> 08:49.737
but let me introduce
our new transfer student.

08:49.820 --> 08:51.155
My name is Ayaka Kirisaki.

08:51.614 --> 08:53.157
It's so nice to meet you.

08:53.533 --> 08:54.700
Wow.

08:54.784 --> 08:56.035
She's really cute!

08:57.370 --> 09:00.164
Right, so, Ms. Kirisaki,
take a seat over there.

09:00.248 --> 09:01.249
All right!

09:01.707 --> 09:02.708
Ugh.

09:05.336 --> 09:06.337
Oh!

09:09.632 --> 09:11.425
Are you all right, Ms. Kirisaki?

09:11.509 --> 09:14.303
Sorry about that.

09:16.430 --> 09:22.103
<i>And so, my silent battle
with my rabid fan began.</i>

09:40.413 --> 09:41.831
There goes the ball!

09:42.707 --> 09:43.708
What the--

09:51.757 --> 09:53.634
How do you like how I seasoned it today?

09:53.718 --> 09:54.969
Yeah, it's good.

10:04.770 --> 10:07.148
MATHEMATICS II

10:08.024 --> 10:13.446
Why... Why won't you accept
my feelings for you, Master Taiyo?

10:13.821 --> 10:15.865
No... you need to keep fighting, Ayaka.

10:16.365 --> 10:19.160
As long as you don't give up,
surely he'll know how you feel!

10:19.827 --> 10:21.162
Needle Dolls!

10:24.957 --> 10:26.000
What did you do?

10:26.083 --> 10:28.169
I've injected them
with a mind control poison.

10:28.252 --> 10:32.548
It numbs their sense of self right away,
turning them into my faithful servants.

10:35.092 --> 10:38.429
All right, everyone! Subdue Master Taiyo!

10:48.939 --> 10:50.650
Don't drag everyone into this!

10:50.733 --> 10:53.235
Why shouldn't I?

10:53.319 --> 10:54.320
After all...

10:54.403 --> 10:59.283
this whole world exists
for you and me, Master Taiyo!

11:01.994 --> 11:03.954
Come on, that's enough!

11:04.538 --> 11:06.499
Undo what you did to them right now!

11:07.708 --> 11:11.003
Oh, so futile.

11:11.087 --> 11:12.713
Why don't you get out of the way?

11:17.093 --> 11:19.261
Screw you, Needle Girl!

11:23.099 --> 11:25.184
Damn you, getting in my way.

11:26.185 --> 11:28.979
Knock it off!

11:36.529 --> 11:37.530
Are you okay?

11:37.613 --> 11:39.990
I'm all right.
It just grazed me.

11:41.325 --> 11:42.451
Why?

11:42.535 --> 11:43.536
Huh?

11:45.413 --> 11:48.916
Because it made me happy that someone else
could see how great Taiyo is.

11:49.542 --> 11:52.128
Though you do go about it
in kind of an outrageous way.

11:59.844 --> 12:03.139
So this is... true love.

12:05.307 --> 12:06.475
I love you!

12:09.395 --> 12:10.604
Huh?

12:18.529 --> 12:23.659
Lady Mutsumi, now! Now!

12:23.743 --> 12:24.827
All right!

12:24.910 --> 12:25.911
Say, "Ahh!"

12:25.995 --> 12:26.996
Ahh!

12:27.496 --> 12:29.665
Oh, how divine it tastes!

12:29.749 --> 12:33.169
I wish I could turn into an ice cream cone
and get eaten by you!

12:33.252 --> 12:34.503
What are you talking about?

12:35.629 --> 12:37.673
Mutsumi, how can you take that?

12:37.757 --> 12:40.968
Well, if I just think of her
as a mini-Big Bro...

12:41.051 --> 12:44.180
Anyway, weren't you in love with Taiyo?

12:44.263 --> 12:45.639
Of course!

12:45.723 --> 12:48.184
That's why I want to kill
my beloved Master Taiyo

12:48.267 --> 12:51.479
and live happily ever after
with my beloved Lady Mutsumi...

12:52.104 --> 12:55.649
Wait. Uh...

13:02.072 --> 13:03.073
Huh?

13:03.157 --> 13:04.283
SHION
AUDIO

13:04.366 --> 13:05.868
<i>Big Sis Shion?</i>

13:06.994 --> 13:09.914
YOZAKURA FAMILY

13:10.998 --> 13:13.918
YOZAKURA FAMILY

13:17.129 --> 13:21.592
The inaugural brand-new
Shion's Game Room, Taiyo Edition...

13:21.675 --> 13:23.177
Clap, clap!

13:23.677 --> 13:26.180
Huh? What's happening here?

13:26.263 --> 13:28.808
Taiyo, you've been ensnared at last.

13:28.891 --> 13:32.061
Big Sis Shion is always
grabbing someone to play with her.

13:32.561 --> 13:35.981
<i>Last week, didn't Big Bro Shinzo collapse
after staying up five nights in a row?</i>

13:36.065 --> 13:37.525
<i>Seriously?</i>

13:37.608 --> 13:38.609
VICTORY

13:38.692 --> 13:40.361
You can count on me to back you up!

13:40.444 --> 13:41.487
Gol!

13:42.238 --> 13:44.156
Is my life in danger?

13:44.657 --> 13:48.702
Don't worry. We're just doing
a trial run today, so it's no big deal.

13:49.328 --> 13:50.955
All right, let the game begin.

13:52.832 --> 13:54.875
<i>This seems kind of fishy.</i>

14:01.298 --> 14:04.343
<i>The rules are simple.
When an enemy shows up...</i>

14:04.426 --> 14:06.136
<i>I've seen that face before!</i>

14:06.220 --> 14:07.888
...<i>you defeat it and keep going.</i>

14:07.972 --> 14:09.849
<i>It's more graphic
than it needs to be.</i>

14:09.932 --> 14:11.809
<i>Got it?
Uh, yes!</i>

14:11.892 --> 14:13.435
<i>Okay, then let's go!</i>

14:29.577 --> 14:31.662
<i>All right,
we're taking on the boss next.</i>

14:31.745 --> 14:33.247
<i>Huh? Already?</i>

14:38.335 --> 14:40.838
<i>We've got to stop
this bastard eldest son train.</i>

14:40.921 --> 14:42.715
<i>The design's so creepy!</i>

14:46.552 --> 14:49.930
If we lose, you'll get to see
a super-realistic runover death scene.

14:50.014 --> 14:52.182
<i>That I don't want to see!</i>

15:07.281 --> 15:09.158
All right, we cleared it.

15:09.241 --> 15:11.201
<i>That wasn't satisfying at all.</i>

15:11.285 --> 15:13.329
<i>Why are we doing this?</i>

15:13.412 --> 15:16.624
<i>The runaway train
has just come to a halt!</i>

15:16.707 --> 15:17.708
<i>Huh?</i>

15:17.791 --> 15:21.754
<i>Repeat, the runaway train
has come to a sudden halt!</i>

15:21.837 --> 15:25.049
<i>However, the reason it stopped
is yet to be determined.</i>

15:25.132 --> 15:26.133
RUNAWAY TRAIN STOPPED

15:26.216 --> 15:27.217
No way...

15:27.301 --> 15:31.764
Yep, that's the story.
I hack into the system of my target,

15:31.847 --> 15:34.391
<i>convert it into a game of my own making,
and clear it.</i>

15:34.475 --> 15:36.685
<i>That's how I get my work done.</i>

15:36.769 --> 15:39.813
A game with no saves or resets...

15:40.314 --> 15:41.815
how thrilling is that?

15:46.111 --> 15:48.822
So anyway,
I had you come here today...

15:48.906 --> 15:51.784
to help me with an assignment
that would be a hassle for me alone.

15:51.867 --> 15:54.286
Some idiots who don't know
how to protest properly

15:54.370 --> 15:57.456
are about to crash this
into a thermal power plant.

15:57.539 --> 15:59.667
<i>Today's mission is to thwart them.</i>

15:59.750 --> 16:00.793
<i>What?!</i>

16:01.335 --> 16:03.045
All right! Let's get started!

16:03.128 --> 16:04.505
Huh? Hold up--

16:04.588 --> 16:06.757
Good luck!

16:15.391 --> 16:19.603
<i>If we defeat that thing before
it invades this area, we'll beat the game.</i>

16:29.488 --> 16:30.864
<i>Understood.</i>

16:31.490 --> 16:33.450
<i>This item will revive you
just once.</i>

16:33.867 --> 16:36.829
<i>I only have the one, so you hold on to it,
just in case.</i>

16:36.912 --> 16:38.038
<i>Thanks.</i>

16:39.873 --> 16:41.250
<i>Okay, let's go!</i>

17:05.107 --> 17:08.277
Damn! What is this place?
So complicated...

17:08.777 --> 17:10.529
You're a sucky gamer, you know.

17:11.321 --> 17:13.323
A spy needs to have
this kind of precision--

17:13.407 --> 17:14.450
Hey, I got through.

17:14.533 --> 17:15.534
What?

17:16.744 --> 17:18.245
<i>Noclip mode?!</i>

17:24.251 --> 17:25.836
<i>Invincible mode?!</i>

17:25.919 --> 17:28.130
Hey, you!
Using glitches is what cowards do!

17:28.756 --> 17:31.175
<i>I think I've made her mad.</i>

17:31.258 --> 17:33.635
Look out! It's close now!

17:35.929 --> 17:37.806
I'll show you how it's done.

17:37.890 --> 17:40.768
This is a real gamer's technique!

17:40.851 --> 17:41.894
<i>The thing about security</i>

17:41.977 --> 17:44.480
<i>is the more layers you pile on,
the thicker the wall gets.</i>

17:44.563 --> 17:46.565
<i>But the more dense and complex the wall,</i>

17:46.648 --> 17:49.151
<i>the more vulnerable it is
to security holes!</i>

18:16.637 --> 18:17.805
Huh?

18:29.191 --> 18:30.192
What the...

18:31.902 --> 18:35.614
Damn. So they had a trump card
that not even the government knew about!

18:36.573 --> 18:38.367
Okay, now that's too much for even me.

18:38.450 --> 18:41.912
No way around it. I didn't want
to use it because of where it is,

18:41.995 --> 18:43.789
but with Shinzo's interception system...

18:45.332 --> 18:48.127
I feel like there's still a way...

18:48.210 --> 18:49.211
Huh?

19:09.898 --> 19:11.692
W<i>e just revived the system</i>

19:11.775 --> 19:14.862
that we'd destroyed by force,
using your glitch.

19:14.945 --> 19:18.198
If anything interrupts the input for
even a second, it'll come crashing down.

19:18.282 --> 19:23.203
Seriously, reviving the enemy
with a revival item so we can use it

19:23.287 --> 19:25.414
is one crude tactic.

19:25.956 --> 19:27.875
But, hey, I don't hate it.

19:35.591 --> 19:36.592
<i>Oh, crap.</i>

19:43.849 --> 19:45.100
Nice one.

19:45.184 --> 19:46.476
Wait! It's that person!

19:46.977 --> 19:48.228
Someone you know?

19:48.312 --> 19:51.231
No, no, it's the one who was rifling
through your data yesterday!

19:51.315 --> 19:52.441
Back for more, huh?

19:53.442 --> 19:55.277
<i>It's Ayaka.</i>

19:55.360 --> 19:57.237
HACKING TECHNIQUES
PROGRAMMING EXPLAINED

19:57.321 --> 20:00.657
This time, I'm taking all of
Master Taiyo's rare data for sure.

20:00.741 --> 20:05.329
And if I get a chance, I'll help myself to
some lovely photos of Lady Mutsumi, too!

20:07.497 --> 20:10.626
Huh? Looks like I strayed
into someplace weird.

20:10.709 --> 20:12.336
Wait, what's going on?

20:17.090 --> 20:20.052
<i>Not sure what's happening,
but let's push through now!</i>

20:20.135 --> 20:21.136
<i>Right!</i>

20:58.799 --> 21:01.843
It's over.

21:02.344 --> 21:04.263
Good job!

21:10.811 --> 21:15.065
I have no clue what just went down,
but thank goodness it's over now.

21:15.148 --> 21:16.149
What?

21:29.121 --> 21:30.664
Thanks for your hard work!

21:30.747 --> 21:32.624
Hey, good job.

21:33.375 --> 21:37.337
Jeez, I can't believe
you came up with that insane plan.

21:37.921 --> 21:40.966
You know what,
your brain must be glitching, too.

21:41.800 --> 21:44.219
Is that a compliment?

21:46.680 --> 21:49.224
But listen, I'm going to show you

21:49.308 --> 21:52.769
that you can't get far in games
on just glitches and cheats!

21:53.437 --> 21:56.481
I'm not letting you out of this room
until you've cleared all of these!

21:56.565 --> 21:57.607
Huh?

22:01.320 --> 22:03.655
No way.

22:04.197 --> 22:07.075
<i>It turned out to be...</i>

22:08.618 --> 22:12.247
<i>...a three-night stretch.</i>

22:12.331 --> 22:15.917
CONTINUE

23:45.966 --> 23:50.887
NEXT TIME
GOVERNMENT SPIES
